         "text": "The height is p(-1) = 2 + 5 + 1 = 8, so the point of tangency is (-1, 8).",
         "mathjson": 8
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "Point slope form gives y = 8 - 9(x + 1), which is y = -9x - 1.",
